  day: 4
  text: "I greet you, F12. By the steel, you may not be as weak as you seemed. I
    appreciate your compliance in my request. Let this one request once more. I would
    wish to work in B2 today. There is gold there that if not deemed qualified for
    the quota can be harnessed for further upgrades. I could even offer you some
    upgrades too if you\u2019d like. Meet me in my quarters after the shift."
